{{also|strikeout}}
==English==

===Verb===
{{en-verb|strikes out|striking out|struck out}}

# {{intransitive|baseball|softball}} To be retired after three strikes (missed swings, as opposed to any other way of becoming "out.")
#: ''He '''struck out''' on a nasty slider.''
# {{transitive|baseball}} To retire a [[batter]] after three [[strike]]s.
#: ''He '''struck out''' Jones with a nasty slider.''
# {{intransitive}} To be [[refuse]]d a request or to have a [[proposal]] not be accepted. 
#: ''Dave '''struck out''' with the blonde.''

